 "changes": [
  "Removed ferry Roscoff - Bilbao (ES): the ETS2 wiki ferry table and the in-game shipping-lines table quoted on Steam list Roscoff only with Plymouth (7h00); Bilbao and Santander are served from Plymouth (Plymouth - Bilbao 17h56, Plymouth - Santander 18h00, Eolo Lines at the Spanish end). Gallia Ferries is only Roscoff-based, and no Roscoff-Bilbao/Santander line is in the game (it also does not run in reality)",
  "City list verified, no additions or removals: the wiki says VLF has 23 cities (15 at release + 6 Corsica in 1.36 + 2 in 1.40, i.e. Bayonne and Lacq) plus 5 towns (the nuclear-plant towns), which with the 8 base-game French cities gives the dataset's 36",
  "Rejected radio_only candidates Cherbourg, Narbonne, Pau, Perpignan, Roudant and St Helier as ProMods-only (none appears in any vanilla city list or SCS patch note found); Orléans exists only as an unfinished non-city location in VLF per the wiki ('planned but left unfinished due to time constraints'), so it is not added",
  "No SCS France rework or new French city in updates 1.50-1.59 (the 1.50 Switzerland rework and the 1.59 Benelux rework of 6 May 2026 do not add French cities), so the base/VLF split stays",
  "Confirmed and annotated ferries Marseille - Porto-Vecchio (14h, Euro Lines / Gallia Ferries, VLF) and Ajaccio - Porto Torres/Sassari (Eolo Lines, 3h30; the Corsica wiki page says it also needs Italia). No Livorno or Bastia ferry is found in the game data, so none was added",
  "Annotated Roscoff (its only ferry is Plymouth) and the Saint-Laurent - Le Mans edge (wiki: Le Mans is reached by a minor road from the Orléans area)"
 ],
 "sources": "WebSearch (11 queries): trucksimulator.wiki.gg Vive la France! page (23 cities = 15 + 6 Corsica in 1.36 + 2 in 1.40, plus 5 towns), https://trucksimulator.wiki.gg/wiki/Vive_la_France! ; Orléans page (unfinished location), https://trucksimulator.wiki.gg/wiki/Orl%C3%A9ans ; ferry table, https://trucksimulator.wiki.gg/wiki/Ferry/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2 (Porto-Vecchio - Marseille 14h; Ajaccio - Porto Torres 3.5h; Plymouth - Bilbao/Santander ~18h; Roscoff - Plymouth 7h) ; Corsica page https://truck-simulator.fandom.com/wiki/Corse ; Roscoff page https://trucksimulator.wiki.gg/wiki/Roscoff ; Gallia Ferries page https://trucksimulator.wiki.gg/wiki/Gallia_Ferries ; Steam discussion with the in-game shipping table https://steamcommunity.com/app/227300/discussions/0/3431201960395400105 ; SCS blog 1.59 (Benelux rework, 6 May 2026) https://blog.scssoft.com/2026/05/euro-truck-simulator-2-159-update.html ; 1.50 patch notes (Switzerland rework) https://trucksimulator.wiki.gg/wiki/Patch_Notes/Euro_Truck_Simulator_2/Update_1.50 ; SCS VLF blog label https://blog.scssoft.com/search/label/Vive%20la%20France%21 (Bayonne/Lacq as a free 1.40 VLF addition). Road km are still real-world estimates, because no source gives the in-game road graph."
